<title>ARGENTINA: Perez Companc Q1 net $74.1 mln vs $60.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Perez Companc Q1 net $74.1 mln vs $60.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to November 30.</p>
<p>	   Q1 1996		Q1 1995</p>
<p>    Net  $74.1 million	$60.3 million</p>
<p>    EPS  $0.10		   $0.08</p>
<p>    ADS  $0.20		   $0.16</p>
<p>    Revs $401.1 million    $371.3 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Perez Companc SA said this is the first quarter of an irregular fiscal year of four months to end December 31.</p>
<p>The company has decided to change its fiscal year to end oin December 31, instead of August 31.</p>
<p>It said results were preliminary, but that the board does not expect them to change.</p>
<p>((-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
</text>
